ping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,36,84,86,76,70],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,36,84,86,76,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,36,84,86,76,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国大臣。出身太原温氏，自幼聪慧，恢少与司马朗、贾逵友善，历仕三县，所在称治。曹操辟为丞相主簿，出为扬州刺史。镇守扬州期间，构筑坚固的东南防线。建安二十四年，孙权攻合肥，恢运筹帷幄，助张辽等大破吴军。曹丕继位后官至魏郡太守。后又赴任凉州刺史的路上病逝。","tc":"魏國大臣。出身太原溫氏，自幼聰慧，恢少與司馬朗、賈逵友善，歷仕三縣，所在稱治。曹操辟為丞相主簿，出為揚州刺史。鎮守揚州期間，構筑堅固的東南防線。建安二十四年，孫權攻合肥，恢運籌帷幄，助張遼等大破吳軍。曹丕繼位后官至魏郡太守。后又赴任涼州刺史的路上病逝。","en":"A senior minister of Wei. Born into the Wen clan of Taiyuan, he was brilliant from childhood. In his youth he was close friends with Sima Lang and Jia Kui, and served ably in three successive counties. Cao Cao recruited him as Senior Officer to the Prime Minister, then appointed him Lt. Governor of Yang Province. During his tenure in Yang Province, he constructed a formidable southeastern defensive line. In the twenty-fourth year of Jian'an, when Sun Quan attacked Hefei, Wen Hui masterminded the strategy that enabled Zhang Liao and others to decisively defeat the Wu forces. After Cao Pi succeeded to the throne, he was appointed Governor of Wei Commandery. He later fell ill and died while en route to assume the post of Lt. Governor of Liang Province.","jp":"魏の臣。太原温氏の出身。幼少より聡明で、若くして司馬朗や賈逵と親交を結んだ。三県の令を歴任し、いずれの任地でも善政を称えられた。曹操に召し出されて丞相主簿となり、後に揚州刺史として出向。揚州を鎮守した際には、堅固な東南防衛線を構築した。建安二十四年、孫権が合肥を攻めると、温恢は軍略を巡らせて張遼らの呉軍大撃破を補佐した。曹丕が後を継ぐと魏郡太守に至り、後に涼州刺史へ赴任する途上で病没した。","kr":"위나라의 대신입니다. 태원 온씨 출신으로 어려서부터 총명하였으며, 젊은 시절 사마랑, 가규와 친분이 두터웠습니다. 세 현의 관직을 역임하며 부임하는 곳마다 치적으로 칭송을 받았습니다. 조조에게 발탁되어 승상주부가 되었고, 외직으로 나가 양주자사에 임명되었습니다. 양주를 진수하는 동안에는 견고한 동남 방어선을 구축했습니다. 건안 24년 손권이 합비를 공격했을 때 온회가 뛰어난 지략을 펼쳐 장료 등이 오나라 군대를 대파하는 데 기여했습니다. 조비가 즉위한 뒤에는 관직이 위군태수에 이르렀으며, 이후 양주자사로 부임하러 가던 길에 병으로 세상을 떠났습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10614","remark":"","surname":"温","surnameTc":"溫","surnameEn":"Wen","surnameJp":"温","surnameKr":"온","surnameOther":"","name":"恢","nameTc":"恢","nameEn":"Hui","nameJp":"恢","nameKr":"회","nameOther":"","word":"曼基","wordTc":"曼基","wordEn":"Manji","wordJp":"曼基","wordKr":"만기","wordOther":"","icon":"温恢","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"197","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"36","wise":"84","politics":"86","charm":"76","will":"70","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"12","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"13/13/13/13/13/76/24/13","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003305","warSoulPoint":"3800","battleSoulPoint":"1200","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"1004408","strategy2":"1001505","professions":"3/1/1/1/3/1/1/3/3/3/2/2/2/3/4/2/2/0/3/3/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"15","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2100","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"178","show":"197","death":"223","age":"0","injury":"","deathRe